<p>You begin to gather energy from other timelines. Your Spellpower will increase by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8.40, 16, 23, 30, 36</acronym> on the first turn and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.40, 2.74, 3.91, 4.99, 6.00</acronym> more each additional turn.</p><p>The effect ends either when you cast a spell, or after five turns.</p><p>Eacn turn the effect is active, your Paradox will be reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 6, 9, 12, 15.</acronym></p><p>This spell will not break Spacetime Tuning, nor will it be broken by activating Spacetime Tuning.</p>